===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:periode<ety:bor<frm:periode<ety:bor<la-med:periodus>>>>|tree=1}}
From {{der|en|enm|periode}}, from {{der|en|frm|periode}}, from {{der|en|la-med|periodus}}, from {{der|en|grc|περίοδος||circuit, orbit, a recurring interval of time, path around}}, from {{m|grc|περι-||around}} + {{m|grc|ὁδός||way}}. Displaced native {{cog|enm|tide||interval, period, season}}, from {{cog|ang|tīd||time, period, season}}, as well as {{cog|enm|elde||age, period}}, from {{cog|ang|ieldu||age, period of time}}.

